{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a game about traveling through parallel dimensions. In each dimension you need to find a way to charge you battery to travel furter. While your battery is charging you are free to explore and interact with that dimension. While you may change the dimensions, the dimension may also change you. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore diverse, conceptual dimensions: Each world presents unique visuals, themes, and puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charge your battery, unlock interactions: Click and interact with objects and characters as your battery regenerates.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel thought-provoking narratives: Uncover hidden stories and ponder deeper meanings behind each dimension.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge your perspective: Engage with complex themes and ethical dilemmas in a playful yet thought-provoking way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive 3D environment: Explore vibrant landscapes and interact with the world in full 3D.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Credits:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aquarium level by Zo\u0451 Sparks and Lilith Zone</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Radio Station level by Skarmuse</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"LAPIDARY GAMER","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2826670/7293b881f7aaed9a0dc544d3d19aed089587b8ec.jpg"},{"name":"CHAIR STORY","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2826670/e6a5dde687cfc5614d2188069af46148c3baaad5.jpg"},{"name":"HEAVEN","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2826670/1c5ca74b3bd3a65141e58c51a48aadd713394237.jpg"},{"name":"END OF ENCYCLOPEDIA","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2826670/76386